BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//Littoralicious//Terroir Split//EN
X-WR-CALNAME:Split — eat & drink checklist
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:split-liste-1@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Gregada — The Hvar fish stew: white fish\, potatoes\, white wine\, garlic and oil\, and no tomato.
DESCRIPTION:Say: GREH-ga-da. The older of the coast's two fish stews\, from before the tomato arrived. Best: Konoba Fetivi\, Veli Varoš — ask what fish came in
LOCATION:Konoba Fetivi\, Veli Varoš — ask what fish came in
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Konoba+Fetivi+Tomica+stine+Split+Croatia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:split-liste-2@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Crni rižot — Risotto made black with cuttlefish and its ink.
DESCRIPTION:Say: TSUR-nee REE-zhot. The coast's own black rice\, which Dalmatia insists is no copy of Venice. Best: Konoba Fetivi\, Veli Varoš
LOCATION:Konoba Fetivi\, Veli Varoš
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Konoba+Fetivi+Tomica+stine+Split+Croatia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:split-liste-3@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Peka — Lamb\, veal or octopus with potatoes\, slow-cooked under an iron bell buried in embers.
DESCRIPTION:Say: PEH-ka. Cooked to your arrival\, so it has to be ordered a day ahead. Best: Ask the Varoš konobas a day ahead — none of our tables re-confirmed it on its 2026 menu
LOCATION:Ask the Varoš konobas a day ahead — none of our tables re-confirmed it on its 2026 menu
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Veli+Varos+Split+Croatia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:split-liste-4@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Pašticada — Beef marinated and braised for hours in wine\, vinegar and dried plums\, with gnocchi.
DESCRIPTION:Say: pash-tee-TSA-da. A Sunday and winter dish of the whole coast\; ask before you count on it. Best: Apetit\, in the palace — ask a day ahead
LOCATION:Apetit\, in the palace — ask a day ahead
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Apetit+Split+Croatia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:split-liste-5@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Marenda at Fife — The mid-morning plate of the working city: whatever the fishermen's canteen cooked today.
DESCRIPTION:Say: ma-REN-da. The cheapest honest meal on the Riva\, eaten where the crews eat. Best: Fife\, Trumbićeva obala\, Matejuška
LOCATION:Fife\, Trumbićeva obala\, Matejuška
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Buffet+Fife+Trumbiceva+obala+Split+Croatia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:split-liste-6@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Ćevapi — Grilled minced-meat fingers in a soft lepinja\, with ajvar and raw onion.
DESCRIPTION:Say: CHEH-va-pee. The stand-up meal of the city\, served the Split way: ajvar\, not kajmak. Best: Kantun Paulina\, Matošića 1\, Centre — cash only
LOCATION:Kantun Paulina\, Matošića 1\, Centre — cash only
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kantun+Paulina+Matosica+Split+Croatia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:split-liste-7@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Burek — Flaky filo pie of meat\, cheese or potato\, warm from the oven in the morning.
DESCRIPTION:Say: BOO-rek. What the city eats at seven\, with a drinking yoghurt. Best: Any pekarna near the Pazar\, early
LOCATION:Any pekarna near the Pazar\, early
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Pazar+Split+Croatia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:split-liste-8@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Soparnik — Two thin sheets of dough round chard\, onion and oil\, baked on an open hearth.
DESCRIPTION:Say: SO-par-neek. Poljica's fasting pie\, an EU-protected name since 2016. Best: Ask at the Pazar on a market morning\, or in the konobas of Poljica
LOCATION:Ask at the Pazar on a market morning\, or in the konobas of Poljica
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Pazar+Split+Croatia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:split-liste-9@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Pršut and Paški sir — Air-dried ham and the hard sheep's cheese of Pag\, the plate that opens a meal.
DESCRIPTION:Say: PUR-shoot\, PASH-kee seer. Paški sir became Croatia's first EU-protected cheese in 2019. Best: The Pazar\, at the Silver Gate\, in the morning
LOCATION:The Pazar\, at the Silver Gate\, in the morning
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Pazar+Split+Croatia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:split-liste-10@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Fritule — Small fried doughnuts with raisins\, rum and lemon zest\, dusted with sugar.
DESCRIPTION:Say: FREE-too-leh. A winter sweet: they appear with Advent and are gone by spring. Best: The Advent stalls on the Riva and round the Pazar\, from late November
LOCATION:The Advent stalls on the Riva and round the Pazar\, from late November
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Riva+Split+Croatia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:split-liste-11@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Pošip — The white of Korčula: citrus\, salt and almond.
DESCRIPTION:Say: POH-ship. The glass the grilled fish wants. Best: Zinfandel Food & Wine Bar\, Centre
LOCATION:Zinfandel Food & Wine Bar\, Centre
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Zinfandel+Food+Wine+Bar+Split+Croatia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:split-liste-12@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Plavac Mali — The great red of Dalmatia\, dark and warm\, from the stone slopes.
DESCRIPTION:Say: PLA-vats MA-lee. A child of the grape the world calls Zinfandel. Best: Bokeria Kitchen & Wine\, Domaldova\, by the fish hall
LOCATION:Bokeria Kitchen & Wine\, Domaldova\, by the fish hall
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Bokeria+Kitchen+Wine+Split+Croatia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:split-liste-13@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Tribidrag — The old Dalmatian red that turned out to be Zinfandel.
DESCRIPTION:Say: TREE-bee-drag. Found as nine old vines in Kaštela in 2001\; now replanted round the bay. Best: Zinfandel Food & Wine Bar\, Centre — ask for a Kaštela bottle
LOCATION:Zinfandel Food & Wine Bar\, Centre — ask for a Kaštela bottle
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Zinfandel+Food+Wine+Bar+Split+Croatia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:split-liste-14@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Travarica — Grape rakija steeped with herbs\, poured small before the meal.
DESCRIPTION:Say: tra-VA-ree-tsa. The truest Dalmatian opening gesture. Best: Any konoba of Varoš\; ask for the house's own
LOCATION:Any konoba of Varoš\; ask for the house's own
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Veli+Varos+Split+Croatia
END:VTODO
END:VCALENDAR
